## Environment

- Interpreter: `.venv/bin/python`. Install with
  `pip install -r requirements.txt`.
- `@@DATA_ENV@@` must be set; everything else is derived.
- Run long jobs in the FOREGROUND and poll for output rather than assuming a
  stall.

Anything this project reads from the environment is prefixed `@@PREFIX@@_`, so
running a second project set up the same way cannot cross wires. Credentials
shared across projects (API keys, database logins) are deliberately not prefixed.
